---
---
<section id="problem" class="py-24 px-6 bg-blue-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold uppercase mb-6 text-ink">The <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-primary">Silent Killer</span> of Gym Growth</h2>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-muted bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm inline-block text-left md:text-center">
            "I'll call them back later." <br>
            <span class="text-red-500 font-bold block mt-2">No you won't. And they just signed up down the street.</span>
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Problem -->
        <div class="card-premium h-full flex flex-col p-8 bg-white border border-slate-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-red-200 hover:bg-red-50/30 group">
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold uppercase text-2xl mb-4 text-slate-800 group-hover:text-red-600 transition-colors">Problem</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-muted flex-grow">
                You're coaching a class. The phone rings. You ignore it. 
                <br><br>
                <strong class="text-ink">Result:</strong> $0.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Agitation -->
        <div class="card-premium h-full flex flex-col p-8 bg-white border border-slate-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-orange-200 hover:bg-orange-50/30 group">
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold uppercase text-2xl mb-4 text-slate-800 group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Agitation</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-muted flex-grow">
                You spend 2 hours a night sending "Sorry I missed you" texts. They don't reply. They've moved on.
                <br><br>
                <strong class="text-ink">Result:</strong> Burnout.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Relief (Robust Reveal) -->
        <div class="card-premium h-full flex flex-col justify-center text-center p-8 bg-white text-ink hover:bg-slate-900 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 group cursor-help border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-900 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2">
            <!-- Default State: Simple Question -->
            <div class="group-hover:hidden">
                <h3 class="font-display font-black uppercase text-4xl tracking-tighter text-slate-900">RELIEF?</h3>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-slate-400 mt-2 tracking-widest">(HOVER TO REVEAL)</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Hidden State: Detailed Answer -->
            <div class="hidden group-hover:block text-left animate-fade-in">
                <h3 class="font-display font-bold uppercase text-2xl mb-4 text-white pb-2 border-b border-blue-500 inline-block">The Solution</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-200">
                    We install a brain. It answers instantly. It qualifies. It books.
                    <br><br>
                    <strong class="text-white">Result:</strong> Scale.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
